; ── HenWen AudioSocket tap (2026-09-03) ────────────────────────────────────
; The tap leg: one half of a Local-channel pair. AS_UUID/AS_SERVICE arrive
; as inherited channel variables (__ prefix) set by app.py's Originate call,
; since a Local channel's ";2" half doesn't otherwise see variables set on
; its ";1" sibling. AudioSocket() streams whatever audio reaches this leg
; (via the Local channel's automatic ;1<->;2 bridge) to app.py's
; audio_relay.py, listening as a plain TCP server on 127.0.0.1.
[henwen-audiosocket-tap]
exten => tap,1,Answer()
 same => n,AudioSocket(${AS_UUID},${AS_SERVICE})
 same => n,Hangup()
; ── end HenWen AudioSocket tap ──────────────────────────────────────────────
